{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"## DECISION NEEDED — how to clear AC8 so this LANDED, CI-verified fix can close\n\n**Status:** the fix (pin uv at `pyproject.toml:354`) merged and CI is green; 7 of 8 ACs are ticked. The close is blocked ONLY on AC8, which greps for the literal `0.12.7` across `pyproject.toml`/`Makefile`/`scripts/check_uv_pin.py` and requires exactly ONE file to contain it. Two do — because `scripts/check_uv_pin.py:16-17` carries docstring EXAMPLES (`==0.12.7` / `>=0.12.7`) that are illustrative, not a second pin. The authoritative pin is only `pyproject.toml:354`.\n\n**AC8 encodes a genuine invariant** (single-source-of-truth for the uv pin); the defect is only that its literal-grep implementation false-positives on documentation. Three options:\n1. Make the docstring examples version-agnostic (`==X.Y.Z`).\n2. Tag AC8 `[non-codebase]` per **ADR 0101**.\n3. Reword AC8 to target only the pin line.\n\n**OSS grounding.** Single-source-of-version is standard practice (setuptools-scm, a single `[project].version`); teams keep the guard but make it *precise* rather than deleting it. ADR 0101's `[non-codebase]` tag exists for ACs that are NOT codebase assertions — but AC8 *is* one, so tagging it would abandon a real check.\n\n**Recommendation:** Option **1** — replace the docstring's concrete versions with a placeholder (`==X.Y.Z`). It removes the false positive AND hardens the invariant: the grep then finds exactly the one real pin, and it won't re-break when the pin is bumped. Preferable to `[non-codebase]` (drops the guard) or rewording (weakens it). Small, low-risk; then AC8 passes and the ticket closes. If you approve, this is a one-line doc edit I can dispatch immediately."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1788226562880132001,"uuid":"d459c13d-55ed-4f6b-b1a7-1c6f67ccad63"}